<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>PVE VM Studio - third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.5; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; } h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  ul.overview li { margin: .2rem 0; }
  .crates { font-size: .9rem; color: #555; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f6f6f8; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-size: .8rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>PVE VM Studio is MIT-licensed. Its binary contains the Rust crates below, each under its own license.
Programs, downloads and trademarks are listed in NOTICE.md in the repository.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul class="overview">
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p class="crates">Used by:
{{#each used_by}}<a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}
</p>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
